@HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

##Memory
###memory as-is
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/memory
Accept: application/json

###memory order and take 1 
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/memory?orderBy[x.name].take[1]
Accept: application/json

###memory case-insensitive search
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/memory?where[x.name.contains(b, StringComparison.InvariantCultureIgnoreCase)]
Accept: application/json

## DB
###constant equality
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db
Accept: application/json

###case insensitve PGSQL search
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?where[ilike(x.firstName,tra%25)]
Accept: application/json

###case insensitve PGSQL search with escape character
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?where[GreaterThan(x.Id, arlan, \)]
Accept: application/json

###PGSQL string split
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?where[stringToArray(x.firstName, ' ')]
Accept: application/json

##random
###
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/random
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/controller/memory?take[1]
Accept: application/json

###select const 
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/memory?select[Name=1]
Accept: application/json

