Accept: application/json
###
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?select[Name=x.firstName + x.lastName]
Accept: application/json

### ordering 
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/memory?orderBy[x.Name].thenBy[x.realName]
Accept: application/json

## counting
### counting
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/memory?where[x.name.contains(Ant)].count[]
Accept: application/json

### counting
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?count[]
Accept: application/json


## Extensions
###translation
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?wybierz[x.firstName]
Accept: application/json

### translation unicode
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?↓[x.firstName]
Accept: application/json


### custom filter
GET {{HostAddress}}/demo/db?where[hasFullName(x, Nolan Cowle)]
Accept: application/json